title: Summed with care, a transcript's token counts equal Claude Code's own to the token.
pid: b7d2e829-b9d5-40ff-bd01-fac1a0d408f5
body: |2-
  A response is streamed into one transcript record per content block,
  and each repeats the whole response's usage, so a naive sum counts a
  request two or three times. Counted once per 'requestId', the sums
  equal the 'cost-state' record Claude Code writes, model by model,
  exactly (checked on every pacer session of 2026-11-12 and 13 that
  used no web tool).
